    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>The most popular FBC ever sold, in its fourth generation. Raven's pitch hasn't changed since the 2040s: nobody has to know. It passes for meat at a glance, and it's the body most people picture when they imagine going metal and keeping their life.</em></p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 11,200eb (Very Expensive)<br><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 17 (5d6)<br><strong>Frame:</strong> Sigma (12): BODY 12<br><strong>Eyes:</strong> Cybereye ×2<br><strong>Base chrome (no HL):</strong> FBC Gemini Sculpt, Shift Tacts, Techhair<br><strong>Chrome:</strong> Midnight Lady™ or Mr. Studd™, Self-ICE, Skin Weave</p><p>Every body includes the standard chassis (Cyberarm ×2, Cyberaudio Suite, Cyberleg ×2, Cyberskull, an Internal Linear Frame and a Neuroport) at no HL, plus its eyes and base chrome. Going metal needs a Biosystem (bought separately) and a Hospital.</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Full Body Conversions</small></p>",
      "alias": "",
      "history": "",
      "notes": ""
    }
  },
